{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `chosen_action`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: reordered the model block so that the parameter `beta` receives its built-in prior before being used to compute `logits`. This preserves the same posterior/log density. No data changes were required.
","model_safe_stan":"// ForestDB translation: Tic-Tac-Toe
data {
  int<lower=1> A;
  int<lower=1> N;
  array[N] int<lower=1, upper=A> chosen_action;
  vector[A] utility;
}
parameters {
  real<lower=0> beta;
}
model {
  vector[A] logits;
  beta ~ lognormal(0, 0.75);
  logits = beta * utility;
  chosen_action ~ categorical_logit(logits);
}
generated quantities {
  simplex[A] action_prob = softmax(beta * utility);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"A":5,"N":3,"chosen_action":[1,2,4],"utility":[6.473870109687564,3.768504101026006,3.864315965584066,6.723496684630948,6.563995800084036]}","protected_variables":["chosen_action"]}
